owed> by at least four strong <10 aftershocks> , IRNA <23 reported> . The news agency also <24 reported> that one of the major hospitals on the island , in the village of Jeyhian , was <13 destroyed> and the village's power lines were <17 cut> . The island's airport was also <15 damaged> . Abdolreza Sheikholeslami , the governor of Hormozgan Province , the center of the damaged area , <21 said> 40 percent to 70 percent of the buildings in seven villages were <5 destroyed> , IRNA <22 reported> . Two helicopters began moving the injured to the hospital in Bandar Abbas , and aid workers began distributing food , blankets and tents in the region , the governor said . Qeshm is Iran's largest island in the Persian Gulf , with a population of 120 , 000 . The quake jolted several cities in the United Arab Emirates , across the Persian Gulf from Iran . Office workers in Dubai , United Arab Emirates , evacuated several buildings in the city , pouring onto the streets and snarling traffic . There were no reported injuries in Dubai . Mehdi Zareh , director of the seismological center in Tehran , dismissed concerns that the earthquake would cause tsunamis , IRNA reported . ''The Persian Gulf is not deep enough so that we can expect tsunamis , '' he was quoted as saying . Map of Iran highlighting epicenter of earthquake : A tremor shook southern Iran yesterday , causing major damage .", "gold": [["11", "causes", "6"], ["7", "causes", "6"], ["11", "causes", "3"], ["11", "causes", "12"], ["7", "causes", "13"], ["9", "causes", "3"], ["7", "causes", "4"], ["18", "causes", "14"], ["9", "causes", "14"], ["9", "causes", "13"], ["18", "causes", "17"], ["11", "causes", "17"], ["7", "causes", "14"], ["18", "causes", "15"], ["9", "causes", "16"], ["11", "causes", "5"], ["9", "causes", "4"], ["18", "causes", "20"], ["7", "causes", "12"], ["11", "causes", "16"], ["11", "causes", "13"], ["9", "causes", "17"], ["9", "causes", "20"], ["7", "causes", "20"], ["9", "causes", "15"], ["11", "causes",